&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;The Dasher Tasks team is expanding what it means to earn on DoorDash. We let Dashers do work far beyond delivery, from photographing a merchant&#39;s menu to assisting autonomous vehicles, to collecting data. Adding these Tasks gives dashers greater opportunities to earn and smoothes a Dashers earnings throughout the day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;The work compounds across all three sides of our marketplace: new off-peak earning for millions of Dashers, real-world capacity and insight for businesses, and everyday convenience for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;We are on our way to building the next billion dollar business at DD, with more than 2 million tasks completed since 2025 and partners across retail, insurance, hospitality, and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;As an Associate you&#39;ll own a slice of Dasher Tasks end to end; sizing the opportunity, designing the operation, launching pilots, and scaling what works. Your focus will flex to wherever the business needs it most: new task types, commercial pilots or international market expansion opportunities,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;First 30 days: learn the business, our metrics, and tooling, and shadow live operations. By 60 days: own a workstream or pilot and ship your first improvements. By 90 days: independently run a pilot or market and move a core metric.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Expect ambiguity, shifting priorities, and few established playbooks. With these complications come outsized ownership, direct exposure to senior leaders, and the chance to shape a multi-billion-dollar new business from the ground up. It&#39;s a rare moment to get in early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You’ll report direction to the Manager on the Dasher Tasks with the Dasher and Logistics Organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end workstreams across Dasher Tasks, from the first hypothesis and analysis all the way through launching and scaling the operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Turn messy, real-world data into decisions: pull your own data in SQL, model in Excel/Sheets, define the KPIs that matter, and lean on AI tools to move faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Partner broadly with Product, Engineering, Analytics, and S&amp;amp;O leadership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Build the playbooks, SOPs, and processes that turn a scrappy pilot into a durable business, and see your work in Dashers&#39; and customers&#39; hands within weeks, not quarters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You have 1-3 years of experience in strategy &amp;amp; operations, consulting, investment banking, analytics, program management, or a high-growth startup/ops environment, and you&#39;ve owned projects end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You&#39;re data-fluent and analytical: comfortable pulling data in SQL and modeling in Excel/Sheets to drive decisions, or able to ramp there quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You operate with an ownership mentality in ambiguity: structured, resourceful, biased to action, and willing to get into the weeds with a high bar for operational quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You put AI to work to accelerate your analysis and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
