&lt;p&gt;The New Verticals Business Development team is a small, fast-paced, high-performing group responsible for establishing, managing and scaling new lines of business at DoorDash in the retail and logistics space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Associate of Emerging Retail Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;, you will support the day-to-day management of our merchant partners and help them grow with DoorDash. This role offers the opportunity to get in at the ground floor of one of DoorDash&#39;s fastest-growing new bets, focused on parcel logistics, and to operate at a startup pace with the backing of an established public company. You will report to the &lt;strong&gt;Associate Manager of Emerging Retail Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt; within our Merchant Business Development organization and work closely with account leads and teams across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own relationships with leading enterprise retailers and ecommerce logistics providers.&lt;/strong&gt; Be the day-to-day point of contact for a portfolio of strategic partners, build a deep understanding of their business goals and challenges, and develop creative solutions that drive step-change growth for DoorDash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the conversation.&lt;/strong&gt; Run merchant calls and business reviews, own the follow-up, and build the presentations and materials that tell the story of the account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn insights into growth.&lt;/strong&gt; Resolve issues using established processes and internal resources, raise concerns early with the facts and a suggested next step, and use playbooks and merchant data to flag negative trends and spot growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex your negotiating skills.&lt;/strong&gt; Support upsells, cross-sells, expansions, launches and renewals that create mutually beneficial outcomes for partners and DoorDash. Use your product knowledge and market feedback to help shape the roadmap and go-to-market strategy for one of DoorDash&#39;s most exciting new bets, and to inform growth and revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn fast and be seen.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with senior stakeholders across Sales, Operations, Legal and Finance, get regular visibility with DoorDash leadership, and have room to grow your career quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build trusted relationships with merchant and customer contacts, and you&#39;re the person they turn to to get things done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know your way around commercial terms and can prepare and drive deals with sharp data and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You rally teams across operations, finance, product and beyond to solve problems and move projects forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You turn performance data and merchant feedback into account plans and growth recommendations you can defend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You show initiative and resilience when priorities shift or the path forward is unclear, and you have good judgment about when to make the call and when to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly in writing and in conversation, with strong attention to detail and timely follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a Bachelor&#39;s degree in a relevant field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in a client-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the retail, logistics or parcel industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast-paced or startup experience, including working on a fast-growing product that is still taking shape.&lt;/li&gt;
