&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring an Associate Manager to join our Retail Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team, with a focus on merchandising across our retail verticals. You will be&amp;nbsp; a part of building our retail shopping experience by understanding customer shopping behavior, developing merchandising strategies for our store pages, and building visibility across retail verticals in-app. You will iteratively test and learn to continuously optimize the site experience for our customer. You will work cross-functionally to translate business priorities into in-app merchandising or product strategies. You will report into a Manager on our Retail Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team and will manage a team of 1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re Excited About This Opportunity Because You Will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and execute merchandising strategies&lt;/strong&gt; across all retail categories including/apparel, home, beauty, occasions, electronics, sporting goods and office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a “best-in-class” shopping experience&lt;/strong&gt; for customers by analyzing sales data, search trends and seasonal priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with technical &amp;amp; non technical stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; to identify merchandising tools and ideate on product roadmap strategy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merchandise and maintain product assortment&lt;/strong&gt; by monitoring business trends, customer demand, historical trends and seasonal variations to determine future growth opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand the consumer&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their demands, analyzing their behavior and determining what they might come to the DoorDash platform for next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Excited About You Because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have 4-6+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in retail, e-commerce or site merchandising&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are analytical&lt;/strong&gt; and comfortable working with large data sets within Excel, Google Sheets basic SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are AI native and have experience leveraging LLMs and AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; like Claude, Cursor and Gemini to automate merchandising workflows, accelerate test-and-learn cycles, and deliver measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have a completed Bachelor’s Degree.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
