&lt;p&gt;DoorDash Labs is an independent team within DoorDash. We&#39;re hiring an Associate Operations Manager to help lead a team working on robotics solutions solving real business problems.&amp;nbsp; If you have a passion for applying robotics solutions to a service loved by millions of people, then we want to talk to you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role acts as an associate operations manager at DoorDash Labs. You will ensure that DoorDash Labs executes operations efficiently and maximizes operations to its full potential.&amp;nbsp; You will report to the General Manager on our robotics team in our DoorDash Labs organization. You will be 100% in-office and in-field throughout the Greater Salt Lake Area with some limited travel potential to other new markets if the need arises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorously tracking daily KPIs and work with all sides of our operations to maximize our output and commercial availability of supply&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong relationships and followership with the general manager, operations team managers and a co-located service team, motivating the whole team to work as one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incorporate, adopt and refine daily and weekly processes for the management of real-time operations, working closely with other leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with cross-functional partners, including remote assistance, technical program management, facilities, engineering and many other key stakeholders to provide an understanding of the current state of operations and resource allocation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute with creative operational solutions to complex and ambiguous technical problems, unlocking the next big autonomy bet&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide onsite leadership and expertise for incident response, in the case things don’t match expectations and need guidance and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively in gray space, bringing clarity to uncertainty, to enable tactical and strategic decision making and push the program forward!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with operational leadership of a team of 10-50&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience in autonomous vehicles and/or robotics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills - you can concisely present complex ideas to subordinates, peers, cross-functional partners and senior leadership alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An “And not Or” mentality - both quantity and quality in our operations matter and we do not consider them contradictory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intrinsic motivation and confidence operating independently as well as with a team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Belief in 1% better every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About DoorDash&lt;/h2&gt;
