&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical guidance, leadership and development for a team growing to 8+ engineers across Android, FullStack and Backend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the hiring process for your team, in partnership with recruiting, to grow a diverse and inclusive team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business and engineering leaders at multinational corporations to help understand their business needs and formulate them into a world class product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with key internal business stakeholders to define the roadmap and vision for our product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with analytics and data counterparts to measure impact and success of products and features delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on technical leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product intuition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to lead full-stack engineering teams - backend, mobile, and some web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-energy and driven - you’ll do whatever it takes to win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an owner - driven, focused, and quick to take ownership of your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Humble - you’re willing to get into the details and you’re open to feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable, resilient, and able to thrive in ambiguity - things change quickly in our fast-paced startup and you’ll need to be able to keep up!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth-minded - you’re eager to expand your skill set and excited to carve out your career path in a hyper-growth setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire for impact - ready to take on a lot of responsibility and work collaboratively with your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in people management, ideally leading a team size of 8+ and managing senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working on a user-facing product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience as an engineer in a product focused development environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
