&lt;p&gt;At DoorDash, our people are at the heart of everything we do. With operations spanning 40+ countries, ensuring smooth and compliant immigration is critical to our growth. The Global Immigration pillar within our Global Mobility &amp;amp; Immigration (GMI) team manages immigration strategy and operations worldwide, partnering with employees, vendors, and cross-functional teams to deliver scalable, compliant solutions that enable global workforce agility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Global Immigration Manager to lead our global immigration program. You’ll shape policy, drive strategy, and manage our global immigration vendor network to ensure scalable, compliant solutions. This is a rare opportunity to shape how a high-growth global company navigates immigration - balancing compliance, scalability, and employee experience to enable our workforce to thrive. You’ll also lead and mentor immigration professionals, fostering their growth and ensuring high-quality delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Senior Manager, Head of Global Mobility &amp;amp; Immigration on our Global Mobility &amp;amp; Immigration (GMI) team within Global People Operations, serving as part of the GMI leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt; our global immigration strategy and policy, designing scalable frameworks and governance aligned with DoorDash’s talent and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee global immigration operations&lt;/strong&gt;, including direct accountability for US immigration - our largest and most complex - ensuring compliance, consistency, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and develop&lt;/strong&gt; immigration professionals, fostering a culture of collaboration, accountability, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across Legal, Talent Acquisition, People Business Partners, and People Operations to integrate immigration into business planning and enable global workforce mobility.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive&lt;/strong&gt; vendor performance, process improvements, and scalable initiatives that enhance compliance, efficiency, and employee experience, helping to future-proof our operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support&lt;/strong&gt; M&amp;amp;A and new-market expansion by leading immigration due diligence and designing solutions that ensure smooth transitions and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act&lt;/strong&gt; as a subject-matter expert and trusted advisor, offering pragmatic, business-aligned guidance to stakeholders globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6–10 years of global immigration experience with deep expertise across multiple jurisdictions, including US and EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve led immigration programs in multinational, fast-paced environments, balancing compliance, business enablement, and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing and developing immigration professionals and driving vendor performance and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a strong communicator and problem-solver who can simplify complexity and partner effectively across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think strategically but aren’t afraid to dive into details to make things happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about using new tools - including AI - to enhance efficiency, insights, and the employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act with integrity, adaptability, and sound judgment in ambiguous situations.&lt;/li&gt;
