&lt;li&gt;Are passionate about food and love to lead across multiple food concepts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy building processes and seeing ideas come to life&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are passionate about creating food consistently&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Want to grow in delivery-only kitchen operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in hands-on, fast-paced leadership roles.&lt;/li&gt;
