&lt;p&gt;At DoorDash, our mission to empower local economies shapes how our team members move quickly, learn, and reiterate in order to make impactful decisions that display empathy for our range of users—from Dashers to merchant partners to consumers. We are a technology and logistics company that started by enabling door-to-door delivery, and we are looking for team members who can help us go from a company that is known as the place you order food to a company that people turn to for any and all goods.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DoorDash is growing rapidly and changing constantly, which gives our team members the opportunity to share their unique perspectives, solve new challenges, and own their careers. We&#39;re committed to supporting employees’ happiness, healthiness, and overall well-being by providing comprehensive benefits and perks including premium healthcare, wellness expense reimbursement, paid parental leave and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Statement of Non-Discrimination: In keeping with our beliefs and goals, no employee or applicant will face discrimination or harassment based on: race, color, ancestry, national origin, religion, age, gender, marital/domestic partner status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, disability status, or veteran status. Above and beyond discrimination and harassment based on “protected categories,” we also strive to prevent other subtler forms of inappropriate behavior (i.e., stereotyping) from ever gaining a foothold in our office. Whether blatant or hidden, barriers to success have no place at DoorDash. We value a diverse workforce – people who identify as women, non-binary or gender non-conforming, LGBTQIA+, American Indian or Native Alaskan, Black or African American, Hispanic or Latinx, Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander, differently-abled, caretakers and parents, and veterans are strongly encouraged to apply. Thank you to the Level Playing Field Institute for this statement of non-discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, and any other state or local hiring regulations, we will consider for employment any qualified applicant, including those with arrest and conviction records, in a manner consistent with the applicable regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you need any accommodations, please inform your recruiting contact upon initial connection.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to Applicants for Jobs Located in NYC or Remote Jobs Associated With Office in NYC Only&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We used Covey as part of our hiring and/or promotional process for jobs in NYC and certain features may qualify it as an AEDT in NYC. As part of the hiring and/or promotion process, we provided Covey with job requirements and candidate submitted applications. We began using Covey Scout for Inbound from August 21, 2023, through December 21, 2023.&amp;nbsp; We resumed using Covey Scout for Inbound again on June 29, 2024, and ceased using Covey Scout for Inbound on April 30, 2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Covey tool has been reviewed by an independent auditor. Results of the audit may be viewed here:&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&quot;&gt;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://click.appcast.io/greenhouse-te8/a31.png?ent=34&amp;amp;e=22630&amp;amp;t=1701374353806&quot; width=&quot;1px&quot;&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://track.jobadx.com/v1/i.gif?utm_pixel=224e990b-8ff4-4287-8d5d-2ff09647f181&amp;amp;utm_ptz=EST&amp;amp;utm_rqt=track&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DashMart Kitchens (DMK)&lt;/strong&gt; is a dedicated culinary team operating within a shared DashMart facility. While we work inside a DashMart building, we are a specialized team focused on preparing high-quality meals for customers ordering through the DoorDash app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work side-by-side with our DashMart partners to deliver a seamless customer experience — supporting both kitchen execution and shared facility standards. We operate as one team within four walls, collaborating to ensure operational excellence, food quality, and a clean, organized environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shifts: Morning, Day, Evening, Weekend, Part-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Kitchen Operations Associate&lt;/strong&gt;, you are responsible for preparing meals to standard, maintaining kitchen and warehouse organization, and supporting order fulfillment within a shared facility environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meal Preparation &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and assemble menu items according to brand and food safety standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure every meal meets quality, accuracy, and presentation standards before handoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow all food safety, cleanliness, and dress code compliance guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warehouse &amp;amp; Kitchen Organization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized dry, refrigerated, and frozen storage areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow cleanliness and sanitation standards across shared workspaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support inventory organization and proper product rotation (FIFO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facility Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with DashMart Operations Associates to maintain a cohesive and efficient site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with light operational tasks as needed to support overall facility success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold a “One Team” mindset to create a positive experience for all team members and customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You’re Excited About This Opportunity Because…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy working with food and have a passion for culinary execution and quality while maintaining food safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to be part of a dedicated kitchen team operating within a fast-paced fulfillment environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market competitive pay (10pm–6am will receive a $2 increase in pay)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AM/PM/Overnight shifts available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for pay increases twice a year based upon performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off (PTO) and sick leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gym membership reimbursement (up to $75/month)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly DashPass subscription (including access to Lyft discounts for full-time employees)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career advancement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We’re Excited About You Because…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re &lt;strong&gt;reliable, positive, and team-oriented&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in &lt;strong&gt;food service (fast food and quick-service restaurants), grocery, or beverage operations, or a willingness to learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re detail-oriented and passionate about &lt;strong&gt;fresh food quality and safety&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can lift up to 50 lbs and work in refrigerated areas (with or without accommodation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;high school diploma or GED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re willing to &lt;strong&gt;complete a Food Handler’s Certification&lt;/strong&gt; upon hire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba2cfdcdb7ab&quot;&gt;Notice Regarding Use of AI and Automated Employment Decision Tools To streamline our hiring process, DoorDash utilizes an automated recruitment tool called Fountain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;168&quot; data-local-id=&quot;939fa77da222&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;How it works:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;Fountain assists our recruiting team by evaluating and scoring your responses to screening questions, resume details, and an AI-facilitated virtual interview. Your interview will be recorded and transcribed, and the interview and accompanying results will always be reviewed by a human reviewer before your progress to the next step. These insights are used to help determine qualification and progression through our hiring process. The tool evaluates characteristics relevant to the role, including job-related experience, skills, availability, and structured interview responses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;767&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e8decfcb949d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Data Retention, Privacy &amp;amp; Bias Audit:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;Data collected during this process is retained in accordance with our Candidate Privacy Policy (&lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://privacy.fountain.com/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;privacy.fountain.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;) and applicable state laws. In compliance with New York City Local Law 144, the independent bias audit summary for Fountain is publicly available for review at &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://trust.warden-ai.com/fountain/ai-recruiter&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;AI Assurance Dashboard - Fountain&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; .&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1120&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2a349fbab67b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Alternative Assessment &amp;amp; ADA Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Use of this tool is a requirement for application progression. DoorDash does not offer alternative manual screening processes based on personal preference. However, we provide alternatives where required by law. If you require a reasonable accommodation under the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) or applicable state laws due to a medical condition or disability, you have the right to request an alternative evaluation process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1601&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d9276ed71b51&quot;&gt;To request an ADA accommodation, please contact &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;mailto:support@fountain.com&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;support@fountain.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; before beginning your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actual compensation within the pay range listed below will be decided based on factors including, but not limited to, skills, prior relevant experience, and specific work location. Base salary is localized according to employee work location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DoorDash cares about you and your overall well-being. That’s why we offer a comprehensive benefits package to all regular employees, which includes a 401(k) plan with employer matching, 16 weeks of paid parental leave, wellness benefits, commuter benefits match, paid time off and paid sick leave in compliance with applicable laws (e.g. Colorado Healthy Families and Workplaces Act). DoorDash also offers medical, dental, and vision benefits, 11 paid holidays, disability and basic life insurance, family-forming assistance, and a mental health program, among others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about our benefits, visit our careers page &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doordash.com/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See below for paid time off details:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For salaried roles:&lt;/strong&gt; flexible paid time off/vacation, plus 80 hours of paid sick time per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#39;Open Sans&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;For hourly roles:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#39;Open Sans&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; vacation accrued at about 1 hour for every 25.97 hours worked (e.g. about 6.7 hours/month if working 40 hours/week; about 3.4 hours/month if working 20 hours/week), and paid sick time accrued at 1 hour for every 30 hours worked (e.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$16.25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$16.25 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About DoorDash&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DoorDash, our mission to empower local economies shapes how our team members move quickly, learn, and reiterate in order to make impactful decisions that display empathy for our range of users—from Dashers to merchant partners to consumers. We are a technology and logistics company that started by enabling door-to-door delivery, and we are looking for team members who can help us go from a company that is known as the place you order food to a company that people turn to for any and all goods.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DoorDash is growing rapidly and changing constantly, which gives our team members the opportunity to share their unique perspectives, solve new challenges, and own their careers. We&#39;re committed to supporting employees’ happiness, healthiness, and overall well-being by providing comprehensive benefits and perks including premium healthcare, wellness expense reimbursement, paid parental leave and more.&lt;/p&gt;
