&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Mechanical Engineering Intern, you will work on all aspects of the mechanical design process, including design, analysis, prototyping, and validation of components and systems for DoorDash&#39;s next-generation autonomous delivery vehicle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design detailed components and sub-assemblies for a high-profile delivery robot, with the support of your mentor, manager, and team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build production-quality 3D CAD models and drawings, and present your work in cross-functional design reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with electrical, systems, and manufacturing engineers to make sure your designs integrate cleanly and can be manufactured, assembled, and serviced at fleet scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn how to validate designs through prototype builds, bench testing, and tolerance and structural analysis, and act on feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are pursuing a B.S. or M.S. in Mechanical Engineering or a related field (such as Mechatronics, Robotics, Aerospace, or Automotive Engineering), have no more than 2 years of full-time work experience, and are available for a May or June 2027 start date (internships are only hosted during the summer).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience with 3D CAD (such as NX, SolidWorks, or CATIA), preferably NX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a solid grasp of engineering fundamentals and use first principles, calculations, simulation, and test data to support design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have shown interest in mechanical design through coursework, team projects (such as Formula SAE or robotics clubs), or personal builds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work independently on assigned design tasks and you want to learn how products are designed, built, and operated at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applications for this position are accepted on an ongoing basis&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
