&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a strong operator to carry out the testing, deployment, and logging of new advanced technologies, working outside and from various offices around the Phoenix area. Two-week training will occur in the Phoenix Arizona Area. In this role, you’ll report to the Team Lead and be a core member of our Field Operations Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shift: This role requires working nights and weekends, with shift hours ranging from 2 PM to 12 AM. There may be a need to rotate between shifts to support operational and business needs. There will be a two week notice provided whenever this is needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires you to be comfortable with riding an electric bike in the Phoenix Area. You will need to be comfortable biking in day/night conditions as well as in traffic/on streets.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage live tests actively in transport, deployment, and safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with multiple stakeholders to improve the product, including hardware, software, and business operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and document tests to verify autonomous technologies, including understanding behavior, product capabilities, new and existing issues, and added requirements&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous attention to process, testing programs, and checklists, ensuring high levels of safety as well as efficiency and reliability of new products&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 years of experience or strong interest in the space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drivers license required, able to support multiple locations in Phoenix, including Tempe, Mesa, Chandler, Gilbert and Scottsdale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working outside and operating micro-mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and enthusiasm with live Field Operations for deployment of products, bonus if related to autonomous vehicles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and process skills, comfortable with following schedules and some evening and weekend work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ticketing tools to collect feedback, schedule fixes, and track progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
