&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://click.appcast.io/greenhouse-te8/a31.png?ent=34&amp;amp;e=22630&amp;amp;t=1701374353806&quot; width=&quot;1px&quot;&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://track.jobadx.com/v1/i.gif?utm_pixel=224e990b-8ff4-4287-8d5d-2ff09647f181&amp;amp;utm_ptz=EST&amp;amp;utm_rqt=track&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The In-Store Sales Development team at DoorDash supports and scales the SevenRooms platform by connecting hospitality operators with powerful tools to own guest relationships and streamline in-store operations. As part of DoorDash’s broader sales organization, this team plays a critical role in driving top-of-funnel growth and building strong, hyper-local relationships with restaurants across the U.S.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Sales Development Representative (SDR)&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll be the first point of contact for hospitality operators exploring SevenRooms and DoorDash’s In-Store solutions. You’ll own the early stages of the sales process — researching prospects, identifying decision-makers, qualifying interest, and securing meetings for field sales partners across your assigned region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who is energized by high-volume outreach, enjoys uncovering opportunities through conversation, and wants to build a strong foundation in sales. You’ll bring discipline and creativity to your outreach while gaining exposure to both inside and field sales motions within a fast-paced, growth-oriented environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with Sales leadership and field sellers to ensure a smooth handoff of qualified opportunities, while building core skills in prospecting, discovery, and storytelling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect this role to be flexible, with some time in office and some time remote. You will need the ability to travel as needed for in-person collaboration through trainings, offsites, team-building events, and other business-related necessities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospect and qualify new merchants:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, contact, and qualify hospitality operators and key decision-makers through targeted outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive high-volume outreach:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct consistent cold calling (including high daily dial volume) and email outreach to generate interest and book qualified meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with field sales: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate closely with outside sales partners to set meetings that move opportunities forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage pipeline effectively: &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain accurate and up-to-date records in Salesforce and internal tools to support clean handoffs and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refine sales skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously improve messaging, discovery, and qualifying techniques through feedback and practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build industry knowledge: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop expertise in the SevenRooms platform, hospitality operations, and consultative selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1+ year of experience &lt;/strong&gt;in a sales or customer-facing role; high-volume outbound or cold calling experience is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to spark engaging conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a fast-paced, goal-driven environment with daily activity targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and attention to detail when managing leads and outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CRM tools like Salesforce and productivity tools such as Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, coachable mindset with a desire to learn, adapt, and grow within a sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in hospitality, restaurants, or technology-enabled services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Notice to Applicants for Jobs Located in NYC or Remote Jobs Associated With Office in NYC Only&lt;/p&gt;
