&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Senior Associate, Insurance S&amp;amp;O to help drive the operational, analytical, and cross-functional work needed to launch and scale multiple insurance initiatives in parallel. This person will support go-to-market execution through experiment management, reporting, vendor and procurement follow-through, and day-to-day program management, helping the team translate insights into product adoption and business impact. You will report into the Insurance Strategy &amp;amp; Operations lead on our Risk &amp;amp; Insurance team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run high-velocity operational tests and pilots that generate insights and help shape new products and programs from zero to one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics and cross-functional teams to track performance, synthesize learnings, and inform go-to-market decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support execution across a portfolio of insurance initiatives as they move from early concept through launch and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with internal teams and external partners to drive vendor readiness, procurement follow-through, and operational launch execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build the processes, reporting, and operating rhythm needed to support growth, including international expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 4+ years of experience in Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, Product Operations, consulting, program management, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong analytical skills, including experience using SQL to answer business questions or evaluate performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience independently managing complex, cross-functional initiatives with multiple stakeholders and moving parts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can communicate clearly in written and verbal formats and turn data and ambiguity into structured recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable operating in a fast-paced environment and balancing executional detail with broader business context.&lt;/li&gt;
