&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://click.appcast.io/greenhouse-te8/a31.png?ent=34&amp;amp;e=22630&amp;amp;t=1701374353806&quot; width=&quot;1px&quot;&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://track.jobadx.com/v1/i.gif?utm_pixel=224e990b-8ff4-4287-8d5d-2ff09647f181&amp;amp;utm_ptz=EST&amp;amp;utm_rqt=track&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DoorDash Labs is an independent team within DoorDash. We explore robotics and automation to transform last-mile logistics in the long term. If you have a passion for applying robotics solutions in a service used by millions of people, then we want to talk to you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior member of our Service Operations team at DoorDash Labs, you&#39;ll take on advanced diagnostic and repair work that keeps our robot fleet running. You&#39;ll work closely with the Associate Operations Manager and own your workload with minimal supervision. This role is fully on-site in Mesa, AZ, on the PM shift (2:30 PM – 11:00 PM), including at least one weekend day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute any Senior Service Technician task and:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose complex, intermittent, or unusual faults in robotic systems, modular components, and support vehicles, often requiring advanced troubleshooting techniques and interpretation of complex data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform advanced repairs, including component-level troubleshooting and fixes on intricate electrical systems, control units, and associated hardware, with minimal supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret complex technical manuals, schematics, and diagnostic flowcharts to guide troubleshooting efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulously document complex diagnostic processes, root cause hypotheses, non-standard troubleshooting steps, repair details, and component failure information in the service management system, contributing potential updates to the knowledge base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical guidance, mentorship, and on-the-job assistance to Level 2 Technicians for challenging tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to manage and prioritize assigned workload effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calibrates, configures, and maintains specialized diagnostic tools and test equipment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of service work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and an inclination for all things mechanical and repair&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and documentation skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in vehicle or fleet service (especially for electric or autonomous vehicles), robotics, or aircraft is a major plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with JIRA, MaintainX, and other service tools and systems is a major plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid U.S. drivers license required and a successful completion of MVR required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About DoorDash&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DoorDash, our mission to empower local economies shapes how our team members move quickly, learn, and reiterate in order to make impactful decisions that display empathy for our range of users—from Dashers to merchant partners to consumers. We are a technology and logistics company that started by enabling door-to-door delivery, and we are looking for team members who can help us go from a company that is known as the place you order food to a company that people turn to for any and all goods.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DoorDash is growing rapidly and changing constantly, which gives our team members the opportunity to share their unique perspectives, solve new challenges, and own their careers. We&#39;re committed to supporting employees’ happiness, healthiness, and overall well-being by providing comprehensive benefits and perks including premium healthcare, wellness expense reimbursement, paid parental leave and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Statement of Non-Discrimination: In keeping with our beliefs and goals, no employee or applicant will face discrimination or harassment based on: race, color, ancestry, national origin, religion, age, gender, marital/domestic partner status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, disability status, or veteran status. Above and beyond discrimination and harassment based on “protected categories,” we also strive to prevent other subtler forms of inappropriate behavior (i.e., stereotyping) from ever gaining a foothold in our office. Whether blatant or hidden, barriers to success have no place at DoorDash. We value a diverse workforce – people who identify as women, non-binary or gender non-conforming, LGBTQIA+, American Indian or Native Alaskan, Black or African American, Hispanic or Latinx, Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander, differently-abled, caretakers and parents, and veterans are strongly encouraged to apply. Thank you to the Level Playing Field Institute for this statement of non-discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, and any other state or local hiring regulations, we will consider for employment any qualified applicant, including those with arrest and conviction records, in a manner consistent with the applicable regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you need any accommodations, please inform your recruiting contact upon initial connection.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to Applicants for Jobs Located in NYC or Remote Jobs Associated With Office in NYC Only&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We used Covey as part of our hiring and/or promotional process for jobs in NYC and certain features may qualify it as an AEDT in NYC. As part of the hiring and/or promotion process, we provided Covey with job requirements and candidate submitted applications. We began using Covey Scout for Inbound from August 21, 2023, through December 21, 2023.&amp;nbsp; We resumed using Covey Scout for Inbound again on June 29, 2024, and ceased using Covey Scout for Inbound on April 30, 2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Covey tool has been reviewed by an independent auditor. Results of the audit may be viewed here:&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&quot;&gt;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://click.appcast.io/greenhouse-te8/a31.png?ent=34&amp;amp;e=22630&amp;amp;t=1701374353806&quot; width=&quot;1px&quot;&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://track.jobadx.com/v1/i.gif?utm_pixel=224e990b-8ff4-4287-8d5d-2ff09647f181&amp;amp;utm_ptz=EST&amp;amp;utm_rqt=track&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DoorDash is building the world&#39;s most reliable on-demand, logistics engine for delivery! We&#39;re looking for experienced engineers to join our fast-growing engineering team to help us develop a 24x7, global infrastructure system that powers DoorDash’s three-sided marketplace of consumers, merchants, and dashers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for Senior Backend Engineers to work on both Product and Product Platform based teams. Product focused Engineers work at the intersection of product and infrastructure to solve key business problems with elegant technical solutions. You&#39;ll operate our backend services and architecture that support all product functionality and will be challenged to consider the big picture -- collaborating cross-functionally, as well as evaluating and executing on trade-offs to maximize business impact for the company. We expect Senior Engineers to be able to own projects end-to-end and mentor their junior and mid level peers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is hybrid with some in-office time expected and will report to an Engineering Manager.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, release and run large-scale web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and define the backend architecture and tech stack for a product area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve performance, reliability, scalability and security for our backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be involved in transitioning our monolithic codebase to a microservice-based architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completely disrupt logistics by tackling bleeding-edge, technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because you have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.S., M.S., or PhD. in Computer Science or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working with backend tech stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in using AI coding tools (e.g., Claude Code, Codex, Cursor) in the full software development lifecycle, including designing, generating code, testing, monitoring and releasing software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze and improve efficiency, scalability, and stability of various system resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with service oriented architecture, writing REST API’s, unit testing, and architectural design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of modern web stacks and architecture (HTTP, REST)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL and NoSQL databases and other technologies (e.g. Postgres, Redis, Elasticsearch, RabbitMQ)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate’s starting pay will fall within the pay range listed below and is determined based on job-related factors including, but not limited to, skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. Base salary is localized according to an employee’s work location. Ranges are market-dependent and may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, the compensation for this role includes opportunities for equity grants. Talk to your recruiter for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DoorDash cares about you and your overall well-being. That’s why we offer a comprehensive benefits package to all regular employees, which includes a 401(k) plan with employer matching, 16 weeks of paid parental leave, wellness benefits, commuter benefits match, paid time off and paid sick leave in compliance with applicable laws (e.g. Colorado Healthy Families and Workplaces Act). DoorDash also offers medical, dental, and vision benefits, 11 paid holidays, disability and basic life insurance, family-forming assistance, and a mental health program, among others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about our benefits, visit our careers page &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doordash.com/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See below for paid time off details:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For salaried roles:&lt;/strong&gt; flexible paid time off/vacation, plus 80 hours of paid sick time per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For hourly roles:&lt;/strong&gt; vacation accrued at about 1 hour for every 25.97 hours worked (e.g. about 6.7 hours/month if working 40 hours/week; about 3.4 hours/month if working 20 hours/week), and paid sick time accrued at 1 hour for every 30 hours worked (e.g. about 5.8 hours/month if working 40 hours/week; about 2.9 hours/month if working 20 hours/week).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The national base pay range for this position within the United States, including Illinois and Colorado.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$159,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$235,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About DoorDash&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DoorDash, our mission to empower local economies shapes how our team members move quickly, learn, and reiterate in order to make impactful decisions that display empathy for our range of users—from Dashers to merchant partners to consumers. We are a technology and logistics company that started by enabling door-to-door delivery, and we are looking for team members who can help us go from a company that is known as the place you order food to a company that people turn to for any and all goods.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DoorDash is growing rapidly and changing constantly, which gives our team members the opportunity to share their unique perspectives, solve new challenges, and own their careers. We&#39;re committed to supporting employees’ happiness, healthiness, and overall well-being by providing comprehensive benefits and perks including premium healthcare, wellness expense reimbursement, paid parental leave and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Statement of Non-Discrimination: In keeping with our beliefs and goals, no employee or applicant will face discrimination or harassment based on: race, color, ancestry, national origin, religion, age, gender, marital/domestic partner status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, disability status, or veteran status. Above and beyond discrimination and harassment based on “protected categories,” we also strive to prevent other subtler forms of inappropriate behavior (i.e., stereotyping) from ever gaining a foothold in our office. Whether blatant or hidden, barriers to success have no place at DoorDash. We value a diverse workforce – people who identify as women, non-binary or gender non-conforming, LGBTQIA+, American Indian or Native Alaskan, Black or African American, Hispanic or Latinx, Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander, differently-abled, caretakers and parents, and veterans are strongly encouraged to apply. Thank you to the Level Playing Field Institute for this statement of non-discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, and any other state or local hiring regulations, we will consider for employment any qualified applicant, including those with arrest and conviction records, in a manner consistent with the applicable regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you need any accommodations, please inform your recruiting contact upon initial connection.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to Applicants for Jobs Located in NYC or Remote Jobs Associated With Office in NYC Only&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We used Covey as part of our hiring and/or promotional process for jobs in NYC and certain features may qualify it as an AEDT in NYC. As part of the hiring and/or promotion process, we provided Covey with job requirements and candidate submitted applications. We began using Covey Scout for Inbound from August 21, 2023, through December 21, 2023.&amp;nbsp; We resumed using Covey Scout for Inbound again on June 29, 2024, and ceased using Covey Scout for Inbound on April 30, 2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Covey tool has been reviewed by an independent auditor. Results of the audit may be viewed here:&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&quot;&gt;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://click.appcast.io/greenhouse-te8/a31.png?ent=34&amp;amp;e=22630&amp;amp;t=1701374353806&quot; width=&quot;1px&quot;&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://track.jobadx.com/v1/i.gif?utm_pixel=224e990b-8ff4-4287-8d5d-2ff09647f181&amp;amp;utm_ptz=EST&amp;amp;utm_rqt=track&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Code Scalability team owns build systems and continuous integration across DoorDash. When a shared dependency changes or more teams contribute to a monorepo, the cost of building software can grow for everyone. We tackle that challenge with Bazel, Buildkite, and infrastructure that keeps everyday development efficient. Our work gives teams a dependable path from a code change to a completed build, with fewer delays and less infrastructure troubleshooting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer on Code Scalability, you will solve the engineering problems behind building software at DoorDash’s scale. A change deep in a monorepo can trigger work across many projects; your job is to make that work efficient, predictable, and easy to investigate when something goes wrong. Projects span Bazel configuration and tooling, Buildkite orchestration, build execution and caching, and the services that support them. You will identify where improvements matter most, make the technical decisions, and work with teams across DoorDash to put those changes into practice.&amp;nbsp;The impact of this role extends to every team that depends on our platform. Shorter queues give engineers more time to iterate, dependable pipelines prevent interruptions, and useful diagnostics help them get back to their work. You will measure progress through those outcomes, alongside the cost and maintainability of the infrastructure you own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve build and CI workflows for large monorepos, keeping feedback fast and changes manageable as dependencies, code volume, and the number of contributing teams grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Bazel rules, toolchains, and integrations that keep builds reproducible and make shared build infrastructure easier for teams to adopt across large monorepos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve Buildkite pipeline throughput and reliability by reducing queue times, addressing build bottlenecks, and making better use of CI compute capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce redundant build work through dependency analysis, incremental builds, caching, and parallel execution, balancing developer feedback speed with infrastructure cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build developer tools that explain build failures and help engineers reproduce CI behavior locally, making troubleshooting faster and reducing support overhead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rethink what a build and CI platform can do with AI: move beyond reporting failures toward intelligent diagnosis, PR triage, automated recovery, and guidance that helps developers move forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instrument and operate build and CI infrastructure. Use metrics and developer feedback to track latency, reliability, and resource usage, then address recurring infrastructure problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead platform improvements from design through rollout, partner with engineering teams on migrations, and mentor teammates through technical decisions and code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of software engineering experience, including building developer infrastructure, build systems, or CI platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write maintainable production software in a language such as Go, Java, Kotlin, or Python, and bring strong debugging and software design skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with build or CI systems at scale and can reason about dependencies, incremental builds, caching, and distributed execution. Experience with Bazel, Buildkite, or large monorepos is especially relevant; comparable tools and environments count too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have led technical projects across teams, made practical design tradeoffs, and carried changes through rollout and operational ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You approach internal platforms as products: you listen to developers, make workflows easier to adopt, and judge success by the problems you solve for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can investigate performance and reliability problems across multiple components, use evidence to find the cause, and choose solutions that stay understandable as the system grows.&lt;/li&gt;
