&lt;p&gt;Notice to Applicants for Jobs Located in NYC or Remote Jobs Associated With Office in NYC Only&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We used Covey as part of our hiring and/or promotional process for jobs in NYC and certain features may qualify it as an AEDT in NYC. As part of the hiring and/or promotion process, we provided Covey with job requirements and candidate submitted applications. We began using Covey Scout for Inbound from August 21, 2023, through December 21, 2023.&amp;nbsp; We resumed using Covey Scout for Inbound again on June 29, 2024, and ceased using Covey Scout for Inbound on April 30, 2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Covey tool has been reviewed by an independent auditor. Results of the audit may be viewed here:&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&quot;&gt;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://click.appcast.io/greenhouse-te8/a31.png?ent=34&amp;amp;e=22630&amp;amp;t=1701374353806&quot; width=&quot;1px&quot;&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://track.jobadx.com/v1/i.gif?utm_pixel=224e990b-8ff4-4287-8d5d-2ff09647f181&amp;amp;utm_ptz=EST&amp;amp;utm_rqt=track&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Labs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DoorDash Labs is an independent team within DoorDash. We&#39;re hiring software engineer interns to work at the intersection of software engineering and robotics to solve key business problems with elegant technical solutions. If you have a passion for applying robotics solutions to a service loved by millions of people, then we want to talk to you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring Software Engineer interns across our Perception, Autonomy Platform, and DoorDash Air Cloud (Foundry) team. Please review the team descriptions below to learn about each. Selected candidates will be notified of which team is interested in pursuing their candidacy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Perception: &lt;/strong&gt;The Perception team helps Dot understand the world through vision foundation models and VLMs, supported by lidar and radar for safety. We tackle rare scenarios, adverse weather, and advances in reinforcement learning and end-to-end driving to make deliveries faster and smoother. We&#39;re seeking exceptional engineers in machine learning, computer vision, and state estimation to turn cutting-edge research into profitable autonomous delivery.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; The Autonomy Platform team is responsible for the software foundation that Dot runs on. We build a wide variety of software frameworks for ensuring the robot operates reliably at an ever-increasing scale. This includes everything from designing the robot&#39;s operating system, building petabyte-scale data processing pipelines in the cloud, and optimizing nanosecond-level compute of bleeding-edge AI models. We are systems-oriented thinkers and hands-on builders who are excited to advance the state of the art in autonomy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Doordash Air Cloud (Foundry): &lt;/strong&gt;The Air Cloud team, also known as Foundry, builds the cloud software that powers autonomous delivery across DoorDash—from the moment an order is placed and deemed eligible for drone or robot delivery, through merchant handoff, to flight management.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe interns are essential to our mission of attracting and retaining top talent. During our 12-week Software Engineer internship, interns are completely immersed in their teams and will have the opportunity to develop, maintain, and ship products. As an intern, you will directly impact our business by collaborating with your team to solve real problems for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the U.S. to be considered for this position. F-1 students are eligible if they are using Curricular Practical Training (CPT). DoorDash does not support students on J-1 visas for internships at this time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The 2027 internship program will be hosted in person at a Doordash Labs office in either San Francisco or Sunnyvale Labs. You will have an opportunity to select your preferred location(s) and team preferences during the application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, maintain and ship technical elements with the support of your mentor, manager, and team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act on feedback, coaching, and mentorship from your mentor and team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively learn about the elements to which you contribute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make a direct impact on our business by collaborating with your team to solve problems for our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in intern programming - Leadership Speaker series, social events – virtually and in-person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present your summer learnings during a final presentation at the end of the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited about an in person summer work experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are pursuing a B.S. or M.S. Degree in Computer Science or equivalent, have no more than 2 years of full-time work experience, and are graduating between Fall 2027 to Summer 2028.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are available for a May or June 2027 start date (Internships are only hosted during the Summer)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working with databases (e.g., AWS, SQL, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a solid understanding of algorithms and data structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proficient experience working with at least 1 object-oriented programming language (e.g., Python, Java, Kotlin, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience writing clean code, working with version control, and doing unit testing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred but not required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
