&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Autonomy software TPM at DoorDash Labs you will play a central role within the robotics team at DoorDash Labs as we scale and optimize last-mile deliveries using autonomy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the manager of our growing Technical Program Management team and will interface with autonomy teams, software, safety, and operations teams on a daily basis to drivie our autonomy stack capabilities forward. This role can be remote, with some amount of travel to our different deployment areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of an exciting effort to develop and manufacture an autonomous delivery robot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our autonomy software teams to deliver meaningful, new autonomy features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program manage and help lead development for our software stack within Perception, Planning, Localization, System Safety, Simulation and Remote Assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive completion of autonomy features from requirements or engineering concept to validated public roads driving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with leaders and engineers across Autonomy, Software, Product, QA, and Ops to plan, track, follow up and resolve issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because you have…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
